This repository includes data from other projects:

- The track table, internal/track/tracks.csv: from Those Who Run v1
  (https://github.com/those-who-run/those-who-run, src/those_who_run/data/tracks.csv
  at v1.0.0), adapted from gt-telem (https://github.com/RaceCrewAI/gt-telem,
  GPL-3.0), which adapted it from Bornhall/gt7telemetry
  (https://github.com/Bornhall/gt7telemetry, GPL-3.0). The rows with ids from
  100001 were learned from our own laps.
- The car table, internal/race/cars.csv: from Those Who Run v1
  (https://github.com/those-who-run/those-who-run, src/those_who_run/data/cars.csv
  at v1.0.0), from ddm999/gt7info (https://github.com/ddm999/gt7info, MIT-0),
  _data/db/cars.csv joined with maker.csv at commit ab025b3.

